## Golden: `static var` dentro de un weave persiste entre llamadas.
weave bump with seed as int into int:
    static var calls as int is 0
    set calls is calls + seed
    return calls

weave main into int:
    var a as int is calling bump with 1
    var b as int is calling bump with 2
    calling print with "{a} {b}\n"
    return 0
